msgid ""
"nothing below, but something unmeasured, something stale, or something a "
"``--skip-slow`` run never looked at"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/devops/reporting.rst:69
msgid ""
"``inconclusive`` is grey and is **not** a pass, for the reason "
"``unmeasured`` is not one: a figure nobody could compute is not a figure "
"above the threshold."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/devops/reporting.rst:74
msgid ""
"**No rendering carries a timestamp, and none names a commit unless a "
"figure is stale.** These artefacts are committed — badges in a "
"``README.md``, tables in this tree — and a date, or the head recorded "
"beside every figure, would put a diff in every commit saying nothing had "
"changed. The commit is named in the one place where it is the news: "
"beside a figure measured at another one."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/devops/reporting.rst:82
msgid "What Jenkins will add"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/devops/reporting.rst:84
msgid ""
"Two things, and nothing else: publishing to PyPI on a tagged release "
"(``make release``), and building the documentation. Everything else it "
"would run already has a name here, and ``make ci`` is that name."
msgstr ""

